{
  "category": "Uncategorized",
  "description": "Fix Scan Features in All Modals on Mobile Web\n\nResolve two issues across all scan modal dialogs: audio feedback (success beep/notification sound) does not play after scanning, and QR code/barcode scanning is non-functional on mobile web browsers.\n\n**Scope:** All scan modal instances in the application — apply fixes uniformly; no modal left behind. Desktop scanning must remain unaffected.\n\n**Requirements:**\n\nAudio Feedback\n- Fix success beep/notification sound in every scan modal on mobile web\n- Address mobile browser autoplay policy — audio must be triggered within a user-gesture handler (not on page load)\n- Provide visual fallback (toast/vibration) when audio cannot play\n\nQR / Barcode Scanner\n- Debug and restore camera initialization + frame decoding on mobile web (iOS Safari, Android Chrome, Samsung Internet minimum)\n- Verify `getUserMedia` permission flow: request, grant, deny, and blocked states with clear user-facing messages\n- Ensure scanner video preview / canvas renders inside modal bounds (not clipped, proper z-index, responsive viewport sizing)\n- Test with common code formats: QR, Code 128, EAN-13, UPC-A\n- Handle front/rear camera selection and orientation quirks (mirror, resolution) on mobile\n\nEdge Cases\n- Camera already in use by another app → graceful fallback\n- Rear camera unavailable → fallback to front-facing\n- HTTPS required for camera API — verify served over HTTPS\n- Modal opened before camera stream ready → show loading state\n- Multiple scan modals on same page → only one active stream at a time\n- Low-light or partially damaged codes → degrade gracefully\n- Rapid successive scans → implement debouncing\n- Scanner recovery after stream interruption or page visibility change\n- Camera permission denied → show settings-prompt fallback with guidance\n\nValidation\n- Test end-to-end on physical iOS (Safari) and Android (Chrome) devices\n- Confirm no JavaScript console errors on mobile web\n- Verify scanned data propagates correctly to parent/calling component\n- Regression test on desktop — existing desktop scan behavior unchanged\n- Target scan response time < 2 seconds on mobile",
